{
  "uid": "roseblue",
  "title": "roseblue",
  "description": "Separate USB diagnostics for roseblue, selected by hardware serial 047B8C32401DC31D. The sensor configuration matches darkblue; the USB debug transport differs. No battery or left-half values are inferred.",
